diff --git a/changelog.d/1620.bugfix.rst b/changelog.d/1620.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..d5bdcb577
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/1620.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix building the ``_rangemedian`` C extension on Python 3.15, where ``Py_mod_gil`` is always defined.
